<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 07 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Nov 07 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $943.3 billion in the week to November 07 from $971.3 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     46.89		48.60</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     24.83		22.10</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  896.47	     922.70</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    186.38	     183.20</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	676.34	     690.56</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    267.03	     280.74</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
